1
00:00:00,487 --> 00:00:02,817
(Amy:)What's going on here?

2
00:00:02,823 --> 00:00:05,543
(Sheldon:)You expressed an interest
in having people over,

3
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:08,042
(Sheldon:)and I feel
I dismissed it too quickly.

4
00:00:08,045 --> 00:00:09,415
(Sheldon:)So, I took matters

5
00:00:09,413 --> 00:00:12,163
(Sheldon:)into my own hands,
and I arranged a brunch.

6
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:13,996
(Amy:)Well, that's so nice.

7
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:15,501
(Amy:)Who's coming?

8
00:00:15,502 --> 00:00:18,642
(Sheldon:)Oh, uh, Stuart,
Bert from the geology lab,

9
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:20,969
(Sheldon:)and Mrs. Petrescu
from downstairs.

10
00:00:20,974 --> 00:00:22,674
(Amy:)You mean the Romanian lady
on the second floor?

11
00:00:22,676 --> 00:00:23,676
(Sheldon:)Yes.

12
00:00:23,677 --> 00:00:25,007
Oh, fun story:

13
00:00:25,012 --> 00:00:27,342
(Sheldon:)she grew up with ten siblings.

14
00:00:27,347 --> 00:00:30,097
(Sheldon:)Or possibly penguins.
Her English is atrocious.

15
00:00:31,602 --> 00:00:33,152
(Amy:)That's an odd mix of people.

16
00:00:33,153 --> 00:00:35,023
(Sheldon:)Well, for our first time
hosting,

17
00:00:35,022 --> 00:00:37,652
(Sheldon:)I thought it would be wise
to conduct a trial run.

18
00:00:37,658 --> 00:00:38,938
(Amy:)You know,
like how I practiced

19
00:00:38,942 --> 00:00:40,492
(Sheldon:)for that Halloween haunted house

20
00:00:40,494 --> 00:00:43,864
(Sheldon:)by going into the bathroom
at the bus station.

21
00:00:43,864 --> 00:00:46,244
(Amy:)You never went
into that haunted house.

22
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,500
(Sheldon:)You never saw what jumped out
at me at the bus station.

23
00:00:48,502 --> 00:00:51,422
(Amy:)Well, thank you, Sheldon.

24
00:00:51,422 --> 00:00:53,452
(Amy:)This is a fun surprise.

